# The generated opcode corpus is a build product, not a source artifact.
#
# `cratonvm-difftest gen-opcodes` reproduces it byte-identically from the
# recipes in src/opcorpus.rs, so committing ~200 machine-written programs would
# put them in every review diff without adding a single fact the generator does
# not already state — and would let the two drift, which is the failure the
# generator exists to prevent.
/corpus-opcodes/

# The coverage matrix is likewise regenerated by `cratonvm-difftest matrix`.
# Commit it deliberately (as a reviewed baseline) rather than by accident.
/coverage-matrix.json
